OL,3,AWhy the King's Caribbean tour could be
OL,4,A'biggest risk of his reign'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal tours are unpredictable beasts.
OL,8,FThe planning is meticulous and dates
OL,9,Fback months, sometimes years, but there
OL,10,Fis always jeopardy.
OL,12,FKing Charles III's visit to the
OL,13,FCaribbean, which starts on Tuesday,
OL,14,Ftakes him to three countries in nine
OL,15,Fdays: the Bahamas, Guyana and finally
OL,16,FAntigua and Barbuda for the
OL,17,FCommonwealth Heads of Government
OL,18,FMeeting (Chogm).
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
