OL,3,AWhy the King's Caribbean tour could be
OL,4,A'biggest risk of his reign'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt also throws him directly into the
OL,7,Fheat of the debate over the payment of
OL,8,Freparations - compensation from
OL,9,Fcountries that took part in the slave
OL,10,Ftrade - alongside questions of whether
OL,11,Fthe King should be apologising for the
OL,12,FUK's role in what he has previously
OL,13,Fdescribed as an "appalling atrocity"
OL,14,Fthat leaves an "indelible stain" on
OL,15,Fhistory.
